  "notes": "{応援|おうえん} means support or cheering.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- No standard intransitive pair\n- Pattern: [noun]⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{応援|おうえん}する\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {応援|おうえん}する (to support, to cheer for)\n- {応援|おうえん}⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{行|い}く→行く：00119_iku⟧ (to go to cheer)\n- {応援|おうえん}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{送|おく}る→送る：00742_okuru⟧ (to send support)\n\nCOMMON COMPOUNDS:\n- ⟦{応援団|おうえんだん}→応援団：26792_ouendan⟧: cheering squad\n- {応援|おうえん}⟦{歌|か}→歌：02179_uta⟧: fight song, cheer song\n- {応援|おうえん}⟦{演説|えんぜつ}→演説：01894_enzetsu⟧: campaign speech\n\nUSAGE:\n- Sports: cheering for teams\n- General: moral support, encouragement",
